  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of Gender Equality Support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xE4;rdering av st&#xF6;d till j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen g&#xE4;ller en utv&#xE4;rdering vilkens huvudsyfte &#xE4;r en bed&#xF6;mning av en finansieringsmekanism (&#x201D;soft-earmarking modality&#x201D;) f&#xF6;r j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet inom &#x201D;One UN-&#x201D;programmet i Albanien. Uppdragets omfattning kommer att specificeras i uppdragsbeskrivningen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is about evaluation services. The main purpose of the evaluation is to assess the soft-earmarking modality to gender eqaulity in the cooperation with One UN in Albania. The scope of the evaluation will be elaborated in the Terms of Reference.</narrative>
